  "headline": "Sucralfate has been on FDA's shortage list for 46 months; current supply at Corvale sites covers 17-19 days and alternate manufacturers are available",
  "headline_cites": ["D6", "D1", "D2", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows sucralfate has been in shortage since 2023-01-04, totaling 46 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 126 units at 7.6 units per day, providing 17 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 193 units at 10.2 units per day, providing 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The primary labeler Redpharm Drug (FEI 3003719240) was last inspected on 2025-08-01 with a VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An earlier FDA inspection of Redpharm Drug on 2017-11-03 also resulted in a VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers not on FDA's shortage list include Allergan Inc. (plant ABBVIE), Amneal Pharmaceuticals NY LLC (plant last inspected NAI 2023-06-07), and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (plant TEVA).",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Buyer should verify current allocation and lead times with Allergan Inc. as the top-ranked alternate, and confirm Amneal and Teva availability as backups.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4", "D5"]
    }
  ]
}
